abmod (1.0.0) bullseye; urgency=low

  * First packaged release, against OpenWebRX 1.2.2.
  * Replaces 31 openwebrx files through dpkg diversions and adds 19 of its own.
  * Refuses to install over files changed outside dpkg, which is what a
    hand-installed ABMod looks like; reinstall openwebrx first.
  * Removing the package restores the original OpenWebRX files.

